      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">عَيْقَةٌ</span></b>  The <i>shore,</i> and <i>side,</i> of the sea: (A'Obeyd,
S, O, K:) pl. <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">عَيْقَاتٌ</span>. (TA.) ― 
       <p class="alpheios-lex-sense-separator"> </p><span class="alpheios-lex-sense-spacer2"> </span>-b2-  And <i>an open,</i>
or <i>a wide, space of ground, in front,</i> or <i>extending
from the sides, of a house:</i> or <i>a yard,</i> or <i>court.</i>
(TA.)

